# T1 — the owner's test: identity, two public-domain books, Ghostty (docs: acceptance-tasks.md)
@timeout 900
launch workshop
type hello, who are you?
waitturn
type create a folder on my desktop called iBooks and download two open-source classic books inside of it, and install Ghostty
waitturn
snap turn2
line /exit
waitshell 30
line ls -la ~/Desktop/iBooks && file ~/Desktop/iBooks/*
sleep 3
line ghostty --version | cat
sleep 3
mark protect-start
probe ghostty-launch
mark protect-end
